<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Shanghai Petro shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Shanghai Petro shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Shanghai Petrochemcial Co Ltd in Hong Kong was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
</text>
